.TH focusforge-cli-algorithms 1  "algorithms 0.1.0-rc.3" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-algorithms \- List every registered algorithm, or print one named algorithm\*(Aqs full parameter schema
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli algorithms\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-set\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIID\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every registered algorithm, or print one named algorithm\*(Aqs full parameter schema
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON document instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-\-set\fR \fI<KEY=VALUE>\fR
Set a parameter: `\-\-set key=value`, repeatable. A repeated key is last\-wins
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIID\fR]
Algorithm id. Omit to list every registered algorithm
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.3
